            "value": {
              "html": "<p>Ре­ши­те не­ра­вен­ство  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\log_{\\frac{1}{3}} (18-9x)\\lt \\log_{\\frac{1}{3}} (x^{2}-6x+5)+\\log_{\\frac{1}{3}} (x+2)\"></span> . </p>",
              "title": "Условие",
              "asset_keys": []
