            "value": {
              "html": "<p>Ре­ши­те не­ра­вен­ство  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\log_{(\\frac{1}{5})} (25-25x)\\lt \\log_{(\\frac{1}{5})} (x^{2}-4x+3)+\\log_{(\\frac{1}{5})} (x+7)\"></span> . </p>",
