            "by": {
              "type": "pipeline",
              "stage": "deterministic_svg"
            },
            "value": {
              "html": "<p>За­пи­шем ис­ход­ное не­ра­вен­ство в виде:</p><center><p><span> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\log_{(\\frac{1}{5})} (25(1-x))\\lt \\log_{(\\frac{1}{5})} ((3-x)(1-x))+\\log_{(\\frac{1}{5})} (x+7)\\iff \\log_{(\\frac{1}{5})} 25+\\log_{(\\frac{1}{5})} (1-x)\\lt \\log_{(\\frac{1}{5})} (3-x)+\\log_{(\\frac{1}{5})} (1-x)+\\log_{(\\frac{1}{5})} (x+7)\"></span> . </span></p></center><p>Не­ра­вен­ство опре­де­ле­но при  <span data-inline-latex=\"-7\\lt x\\lt 1\"></span>, по­это­му при  <span data-inline-latex=\"-7\\lt x\\lt 1\"></span> не­ра­вен­ство</p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\log_{(\\frac{1}{5})} 25\\lt \\log_{(\\frac{1}{5})} (3-x)+\\log_{(\\frac{1}{5})} (x+7)\"></span> </p></center><p>при­ни­ма­ет вид:</p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"25\\gt (3-x)(x+7)\\iff 25\\gt 21-4x-x^{2}\\iff x^{2}+4x+4\\gt 0\"></span>,</p></center><p>от­ку­да <span data-inline-latex=\"x\\ne -2\"></span>. Учи­ты­вая огра­ни­че­ние  <span data-inline-latex=\"-7\\lt x\\lt 1\"></span>, по­лу­ча­ем:  <span data-inline-latex=\"-7\\lt x\\lt -2\"></span>;  <span data-inline-latex=\"-2\\lt x\\lt 1\"></span>.</p>",
